    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blend_It is a minimalist, comfortable puzzle game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to combine the simple figures provided to fit the images presented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>a puzzle game with a new mechanism</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend_It is a game that uses only black and white colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White has a value of 1, and black has a value of 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can edit the combination by selecting shapes, selecting multiplication, addition, and subtraction operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of colors as numbers, use operators, layering shapes to create new shapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>a constant challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently a total of 100 stages for Blend_It. (We're still updating it.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have completed the 100th stage, the infinite mode created by AI will be lifted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience new stages constantly through Infinite Mode!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blend_It is a minimalist, comfortable puzzle game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to combine the simple figures provided to fit the images presented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>a puzzle game with a new mechanism</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend_It is a game that uses only black and white colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White has a value of 1, and black has a value of 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can edit the combination by selecting shapes, selecting multiplication, addition, and subtraction operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of colors as numbers, use operators, layering shapes to create new shapes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>a constant challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently a total of 100 stages for Blend_It. (We're still updating it.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have completed the 100th stage, the infinite mode created by AI will be lifted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience new stages constantly through Infinite Mode!</p>",
    "short_description": "Blend_It gives players a simple black-and-white image. The image has a value of 1 for white and 0 for black. These color values are combined through three operators: multiplication, addition, and subtraction Make it a more complex image!",
